Third-party notices for @inkbar/core

This package includes character widths of the standard PDF fonts (Helvetica, Times and Courier),
taken from @pdf-lib/standard-fonts 1.0.0 (https://github.com/Hopding/standard-fonts). The widths
are Adobe's metrics for those fonts. The Helvetica and Times widths ship in the built files, in
the tables the text measure reads. The Courier width (600 in every face) is copied into the
generated source too, but the measure does not read it: Courier is measured at the advance of the
fonts browsers use for it.

